# Generated prompt corpora contain raw third-party chat text harvested from
# real users (WildChat / LMSYS / committed transcripts). That text can include
# pasted secrets (API keys) and PII, and GitHub push protection will (rightly)
# block it. Keep the raw corpora OUT of the repo — they are fully reproducible
# from the scripts. Commit only the aggregate *_stats.json (counts, no raw text).
webchat_wildchat_corpus.json
webchat_lmsys_corpus.json
webchat_corpus.json
vibe_spectrum_wildchat_corpus.json
vibe_spectrum_lmsys_corpus.json

# Readable samples also contain raw prompt text — keep them out too.
webchat_sample.txt
webchat_*_sample.txt

# Backups people make while iterating on limits
webchat_*_1003*.json
*_corpus.backup.json
